}

/* ── Responsive layer ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   The plugin's interface dimensions are declared here, once, and switch by
   device class. Phone-specific tweaks used to be appended per-rule in place,
   and every screen drifted differently.
   --qiaomu-reader-tap    minimum control size: 44px under a finger (Apple and
